d added variety.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong> \u2013 push beyond wave 30 into an infinite challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save &amp; resume anytime</strong> \u2013 continue your run whenever you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta-progression</strong> \u2013 unlock towers, characters, and upgrades between runs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>52 achievements</strong> \u2013 to test your creativity and mastery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge. Evolve. Adapt. Survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long can you last against the horde?</p>",
